---
import {themes} from '../lib/omarchy-themes';
interface Props {theme:typeof themes[number]}
const {theme}=Astro.props;
---
<div class="theme-miniature" data-theme={`omarchy-${theme.id}`} aria-hidden="true">
 <div class="mini-top"><span>STUDIO / 01</span><span>•••</span></div>
 <div class="mini-inner"><div class="mini-sidebar"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="mini-main"><small>给一个想法，留点空间。</small><strong>慢慢做，认真玩。</strong><div class="mini-lines"><span></span><span></span></div><div class="mini-actions"><span class="ds-btn ds-btn-primary ds-btn-sm">开始创作</span><span class="mini-secondary">看看笔记 ↗</span></div></div></div>
 <div class="mini-bottom"><span>设计中的想法</span><span class="ds-badge ds-badge-soft ds-badge-primary ds-badge-sm">进行中</span></div>
</div>
<style>
.theme-miniature{background:var(--color-base-100);color:var(--color-base-content);border-radius:var(--radius-box);overflow:hidden;font-family:var(--style-body-font);border:1px solid var(--color-base-300)}.mini-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:14px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-base-300);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.08em}.mini-inner{display:flex;min-height:190px}.mini-sidebar{width:42px;flex-shrink:0;border-right:1px solid var(--color-base-300);padding:25px 15px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px}.mini-sidebar i{width:9px;height:9px;border:1px solid currentColor;opacity:.4}.mini-sidebar i:first-child{background:var(--color-primary);border-color:var(--color-primary);opacity:1}.mini-main{padding:var(--style-space) 19px 22px;min-width:0;flex:1}.mini-main small{font:10px/1.5 system-ui;color:var(--color-base-content);opacity:.72}.mini-main strong{font:500 22px/1.4 var(--style-heading-font);display:block;margin:7px 0 12px;white-space:nowrap}.mini-lines{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}.mini-lines span{height:3px;width:88%;background:var(--color-base-content);opacity:.12}.mini-lines span+span{width:62%}.mini-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;margin-top:22px}.mini-secondary{font-size:9px;opacity:.7}.mini-bottom{padding:11px 18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:var(--color-base-200);font:9px/1.4 system-ui;gap:10px}.mini-actions .ds-btn{font-size:10px;min-height:28px;height:28px;padding-inline:12px}
</style>
